  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: pyjwt 2.14.0+rhlw.1",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released pyjwt 2.14.0+rhlw.1 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-101918 and CVE-2026-102275.\n\nCVE-2026-101918: PyJWT: Unauthenticated RecursionError DoS in pre-verification payload parse (PyJWKClient.get_signing_key_from_jwt / verify_signature=False)\n\nCVE-2026-102275: PyJWT accepts inconsistent OKP x/d JWKs, causing public/private key identity confusion\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for pyjwt 2.14.0 from PyPI.",
